    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d785">

                <pb facs="0909" n="813" xml:id="pg813"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.48/1571: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Commissioner at
                        Riga</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Young</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-08-23T13:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 23,
                                1921—1 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>96. Your 492.</p>
                <p>Amend American Relief Administration party’s passports to include Russia and
                    object of visit to “American Relief Administration”. They are to be permitted to
                    carry passports into Soviet Russia.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
